OL,3,AUS country music star Ella Langley
OL,4,Acancels show due to 'security threat'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCpt Richard Meulenberg from Tulsa
OL,7,FPolice Department said a person had
OL,8,Fcalled saying "great harm" would be
OL,9,Fdone at the event with "shots fired and
OL,10,Fbombs."
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
